* <Natural Source Header
* Program   XXCHCKCP
* Version   3.5
* Function  Check string for existing codepage and convert
*           Windows/Unix syntax to Natural syntax
*
* Maintenance
* -----------
* uuuuuu  yyyy-mm-dd iTrac       Remark
* fhi     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1719 created.
* fhi     2016-11-23 NOMALL-1962 Add better codepage support
* fhi     2017-01-17 NOMALL-1962 same, no tags.
* fhi     2017-02-06 NOMALL-1962 same, no tags.
* fhi     2017-05-24 NOMALL-2022 BS2000 codepages added, no tags
* SU1     2017-07-25 new functions:?/-/D
* fhi     2018-03-21 NOMALL-1918 Allow individual codepages (XXTR2U16)
* SU2     2018-03-26             cp longer 8 chars cant be user cp
* fhi     2018-09-06 NOMALL-2125 Add format AAANNNN... of CP-Name
* fhi     2018-11-23 NOMALL-1918 Honor Natural CP
* fhi     2019-07-15 NOMALL-2275 No error returned if member name >8 chr
* SU3     2019-10-30 NOMALL-2324 avoid XXCPAGU NOM9170
* SU4     2020-11-10 NOMALL-2440 recat for VMONIT-L
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA
*
PARAMETER
1 FUNCTION        (A1) BY VALUE
  /* '#' Get number from name
  /* 'N' Get name from number
  /* '?' help - select
  /* '-' 'internal' function:check uniqueness of numbers and names
  /* 'D' help for 'Defaults'
1 CP-NUMBER       (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE RESULT
1 CP-NAME         (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE RESULT
1 CP-DESCRIPTION  (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE RESULT
1 ERC             (N4) BY VALUE RESULT
*                      /* return code:
*                      /* 0=CP found and can be converted by Natural
*                      /* 1=CP not usable by Natural
*                      /* 2=Invalid function
*                      /* 3=help-nothing selected
*                      /* 4=user codepage in SYSNOMU detected
*                      /* 5=CP empty
************************************************************************
